@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Digital Document Issuance & Verification

actor "Student" as Student
actor "Department Admin" as Admin
actor "Third-Party Verifier" as Verifier
participant "EduCore Web App" as App
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
storage "MinIO Storage" as MinIO

== Request & Approval ==
Student -> App : Submit request for Academic Document (e.g. Study Certificate)
App -> DB : Insert documents record (status: pending_review)
Admin -> App : Review pending document requests
Admin -> App : Click 'Approve & Issue'

== Cryptographic Generation & QR Embedding ==
App -> DB : Generate unique verification_token & record in document_verifications
App -> App : Generate QR Code pointing to /verify/{token}
App -> App : Compile PDF certificate with embedded QR Code & registrar seal
App -> MinIO : Store compiled PDF in storage
App -> DB : Update documents status to 'issued'
App -> Student : Send notification 'Document ready for download'

== Public Verification ==
Verifier -> App : Scan QR Code -> GET /verify/{token}
App -> DB : Look up document_verifications where token = {token}
alt Token Valid & Active
  App --> Verifier : Display Verified Official Credential (Student Name, Program, Issue Date)
else Token Invalid or Revoked
  App --> Verifier : Display Warning (Document Invalid or Revoked)
end

@enduml
